<div class="mandarin-hanzi">医生</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">yīshēng</div>

''Meaning:'' doctor; physician  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
医生在医院工作。 — Yīshēng zài yīyuàn gōngzuò. — The doctor works at the hospital.

!! Usage note
医生 (yīshēng) is the person; 医院 (yīyuàn) is the facility. 看医生 (kàn yīshēng) means 'see a doctor'. 医师 (yīshī) is a more formal professional term.
